# Gift of Doom turned face up, its controller picks the Bears and then
# declines the Optional$ attach (AttachEffect.java:144-146). The face-up Aura
# is attached to nothing, so the state-based check puts it into its owner's
# graveyard (CR 704.5m).
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 W
tapformana human 3 W
queue paygeneric W
castspell human 1
resolvestack
tapformana human 4 U
tapformana human 5 U
tapformana human 6 U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue targets 8
queue action human activate 7 0
queue cardchoice 10
queue confirmeffect false
passpriority
resolvestack
